<title>SWEDEN: Ave yield 7.39 pct on Swedish 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Ave yield 7.39 pct on Swedish 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The accepted yield on an auction of 3.0 billion crowns of ten-year bonds was 7.39 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>						Loan 1038</p>
<p>Volume issued (millions)		  2,999</p>
<p>Total bids    (millions)		  4,440</p>
<p>Number of accepted bids			46</p>
<p>Number of bids				   67</p>
<p>Lowest yields				     7.36 pct</p>
<p>Highest yields				    7.40 pct</p>
<p>Weighted average yield			  7.39</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
